#HELPS

0 DINDUCT~
Syntax: dinduct <room target>
Drow house induction for a Drow whose native house rank is 3 or better.
The target must be a Drow with no house and the native eligible-player flag.
Copies your house to the target, sets its rank to 5 and saves it.
This is house membership, not creation of a different class or hybrid.
~

0 PROMOTION~
Syntax: promotion <room target>
Drow house promotion. Requires a player Drow of your own house below you
in its hierarchy. Raises the target one native rank and saves it.
You cannot promote someone to your own rank or above.
This is separate from Ninja PROMOTE.
~

0 FAILURE~
Syntax: failure <room target>
Drow house demotion. Requires a player Drow of your own house below you
in its hierarchy. Lowers the target one rank, at most to native rank 5,
and saves it. This is separate from Ninja DEMOTE.
~

0 ATTUNEMENT DROWATTUNE~
Syntax: attunement <carried owned object>
Requires the Attunement gift from PRAYER.
Sets native item loyalty on an eligible object already claimed by you.
Quest tokens, ammunition, eggs, voodoo items, money, treasure, pages and
artifacts are excluded. It does not claim another player's equipment.
The registered command is ATTUNEMENT.
~

0 ACIDBOLT~
Syntax: acidbolt [room target]
Requires the AcidBolt gift. Uses the current opponent first, otherwise a
named room target. Performs the native acid-bolt combat attack and wait.
Rejects self, group members, non-PK player combat and native safe targets
before attempting to drop Majesty. It is not CAST 'acid blast'.
~

0 FAERIEFIRE~
Syntax: faeriefire <room target>
Requires the FaerieFire gift. Rejects self/group/non-PK/protected targets.
Player anti-magic can resist. Applies native faerie-fire light plus
-50 hitroll, damage roll and armor for 10 native affect durations.
Cannot stack on an already outlined target; command wait applies.
This Drow command is distinct from CAST 'faerie fire'.
~

0 SUMMONSPIDER~
Syntax: summonspider
Requires the SummonSpider gift and an unused native follower slot.
Creates the fiendish spider with 30000 health, 1000 mana and combat
ratings derived from yours, using the native guardian/charm framework.
The shared follower limit applies; this is not an unlimited pet army.
Missing mobile, staging-room or guardian-affect data fails before
reserving a follower slot.
~

0 DROWARMOR~
Syntax: drowarmor <cloak|helmet|breastplate|bracer|crossbow>
Creates and claims the selected native Drow equipment template.
Each item costs 8000 Drow points and 400 quest points; missing templates
and invalid selections do not deduct the price.
The crossbow is used by SHOOT, not as a replacement for CHANT or CAST.
~

0 DIMENSIONDOOR DROWDOOR~
Syntax: dimensiondoor <world target>
Base Drow travel to an eligible target's different room.
Player targets must allow SUMMON. Native target-level, familiar-eye,
illusion and destination-safe/private/solitary exclusions apply.
Combat/timers, caster curse/web/root, disembodied forms, incompatible
planes and either room's no-travel/private/solitary flags block travel.
Moves only the caster; does not create a persistent portal or pull the
target to you. The registered command is DIMENSIONDOOR.
~

0 SKIPDISC~
Syntax: skipdisc
Requires the SkipDisc gift. Toggles native flight on or off using the
character's flying flag, not an unrelated equipment flag.
The learned gift also contributes the native passive speed bonus.
This does not train a spell, grant Dragon wings or change parent class.
~

0 DROWUPKEEP~
Syntax: drowupkeep
Displays your learned Drow gifts and native Speed rank.
This is an inspection command, not a purchase, upkeep-fee setting or
automatic claim that every gift is currently active.
See HELP PRAYER for acquisition costs and command names.
~

0 GLOBEDARKNESS~
Syntax: globedarkness
Requires the Darkness gift (purchased through PRAYER).
Activating the native globe costs 500 Drow points; using it again
removes its active flag. Native visibility/combat rules use that flag.
It is not an independent elemental shield or permanent room-area edit.
~

0 SHOOT~
Syntax: shoot <north|east|south|west|up|down> <target>
Drow crossbow attack into one adjacent room through an open exit.
Hold an ITEM_MISSILE crossbow. A committed shot costs 500 Drow points;
shots into walls/closed doors can waste that price.
Protected rooms, safe/NOKILL targets, group members and non-PK player
targets are rejected before payment; the shooter stays in its own room.
Damage uses native damage roll (reduced against players). Survivors may
receive the native sleep effect; Drow poison immunity resists that effect.
It does not apply sleep to a dead or relocated victim.
~

